{"title":"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/a/8ea52ef8f6d0fc8efa12f6a25e4d577daa60238d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{x} - x^{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/4/974a71a06ae5c6bc0237ab45e4b2ac3807f89818.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ -2 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 3 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"410\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab0becb28188439518893f112dede9f124608e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{x} - x^{3} = 3^2 - 2^3 = 9 - 8 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"284\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <